    "headline": "Ice molds?",
    "description": "Ice molds? Why are you reviewing ice molds, you might ask? Well, I got them on Vine so I thought they were cool (ha), and I thought I would run them through the ringer. The company selling the product is Bangp. This mold is solid for a few reasons, and I would recommend it if you're a baseball fan. Direct product link Construction and material The mold is 100% BPA free silicone and feels sturdy and durable. Made in China Mold is 5.6\"L x 5.6\"W x 2.6\"H and is arranged in a square, or a \"Diamond\" if you turn it 🤣 The ice is easy to remove from the mold, no issues with sticking or broken cubes (balls?) The design is beautiful, perfectly replicating a baseball. Form and functionality Bottom view If you have multiple molds you can stack them in the freezer. Filling the molds is easy; once you close it up, you can add water in the top spout, see image on the right. Some water leaks out of the top spout when filling but it doesn't impact the mold shape Image from product page on Amazon Final opinion Flexible mold that is easy to fill Perfectly designed baseball shape and detail Easy to extract ice and ability to make 4 at a time Stackable design for multiple trays BPA free and priced well",
