    "description": "Get this product Bag in open position The baseball seed pouch is the perfect size for your back pocket and stays closed so you can worry less about rogue seeds in your pocket. Easily fill this up and stash it for the game. Parents will find this a fun gift for teams. Quality The bag is canvas and the clasp is metal so it feels durable. I am unsure if you can machine wash it, but you can likely clean with mild soap and water and air dry it. The image on the bag is solid and doesn't feel like it would come off easy Ease of use I found the bag to be easy to open with 2 hands, but not with 1 as suggested. The clasp does close firmly, so rest easy that seeds will not be escaping the clutches of this bag. Size It's about the perfect size for a back pocket on baseball pants. Being made of canvas, it is flexible and can be tucked away. Careful sitting down as the clasp is metal and you may bend it. Final thoughts It's a solid back that looks good and will hold snacks, seeds, or anything you want. It's. a great gift for any little leaguer, or maybe those softball dads in need of a snack pouch. Caution, does not hold beer. Pick this up on Amazon Back to Reviews",
