    "headline": "The Raubay camera monitor mount device is something I was looking for a long time ago. I had always purchased a separate desk mount like the one pictured to the left of my Sony ZV-E10 Mark II and they work great, but having them behind your monitor meant you had to move the monitor forward a bit to allow it room.",
